        {
          "finding": "The change is safe because each parent already admits the fixed release and the shipped code holds none of the three packages. A fixture that repeats react-native-bootsplash toAsset() on logo@4x.png and on an SVG gave the same height and PNG bytes under sharp 0.35.4 and 0.35.5. Six editor commands parsed to the same tokens under shell-quote 1.9.0 and 1.12.0. The release iOS bundle and the server output contain no marker strings from sharp, shell-quote or joi.",
