          "commit": "e004230",
          "patch": "8aebca83dd67c2a7437a9bcd7956978f7fac1c24"
        },
        {
          "finding": "npm update changed only sharp, its @img platform packages (0.35.5, libvips 1.3.4, Linux included) and shell-quote. The joi lock entry was set from registry metadata after npm 10.9.9 kept 17.13.7; 17.13.8 has the same dependencies and no install scripts. launch-editor calls only parse() on REACT_EDITOR, and react-devtools-core bundles its own copy, so neither reaches the quote() path the critical advisory names.",
          "cites": "Steps 3",
          "commit": "e004230",
